    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021dabe0da1d0003f8ec0307",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓三冠路线，是以经典级的三场GⅠ\n『皐月赏』『日本德比』『菊花赏』\n为目标的路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15e4d76960c00b213d8650b9c20da641e8574cfe8038fbd85c585e5264af463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
