    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de889dc048a8fa1dda85fa48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这些比赛中获胜是了不起的伟业，\n比方说仅仅赢下『皐月赏』也能荣获\n『皐月赏赛马娘』这样的荣誉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91327c1fb05df85bd5f7f75f31cc07414b61a614aa734d4c4f9b60aa581ad04e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
