    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d916599da8630dfc10661af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话虽如此，\n我想在首战『皐月赏』之前再安排一场比赛。\n比如说，12月举办的那个大舞台――",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a56b93a2025ac3f07b6b918afa2f265be55e8842789d8a7d07a8640967bd27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
