      "uid": "zhcn:392bc8580836c5d20352663e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是新马级中距离冠军的决定赛，\n是被称为经典级战线的登龙门的\n草地2000mGⅠ比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7adad9f9a0d90b08ae3755ec9cfbbb6d63981c7479f3dc6d470c4547f77d57d",
